---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '如何申请2026年中国旅游签证（L型）：分步指南';
const description = '2026年申请中国L型旅游签证的完整分步指南。官方文件、新冠肺炎在线表格、预约、费用和常见问题。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/" class="text-sm text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">← 签证和入境</a>
      <div class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">旅游签证</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        How to Apply for China Tourist Visa (L-Type) 2026: A Step-by-Step Guide
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-1"><strong>官方门户网站：</strong></p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
          <li>📋 <a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">COVA在线表格</a> — Fill in your visa application</li>
          <li>📖 <a href="https://consular.mfa.gov.cn/VISA/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">领事事务签证指南</a> — Official step-by-step guidance</li>
          <li>📍 <a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">签证申请中心</a> — Find your local center & book appointments</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If you've read our <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">中国签证类型完整指南</a> and confirmed you need an L-type tourist visa — here's exactly how to apply, step by step, using the official online system.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你需要L型签证吗？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>在以下情况下，您需要L型旅游签证：</strong>
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Your passport is NOT from one of the <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-free/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">50个免签证国家</a></li>
        <li>You do NOT have a qualifying third-country itinerary for <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/transit-240/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">240小时过境</a></li>
        <li>您计划前往中国旅游（非工作、学习或商务）</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        L-type visas are typically issued for 30, 60, or 90 days per entry. Multiple-entry options are available depending on your nationality and visa history.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你需要什么文件？</h2>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Based on the <a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/wgrlh/lhqz/cjwdn_660600/201407/t20140717_961493.shtml" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国领事事务官方网站</a>, here's what you must prepare:
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">基本文件（每个人）</h3>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left">
          <thead class="bg-gray-50">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Document</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Requirement</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">有效护照</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">至少还有6个月的有效期，至少有2页空白签证页</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">签证申请表</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">Completed online via <a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">COVA系统</a>，然后打印并亲笔签名</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">护照照片</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">1张近期彩色照片-48mm×33mm，白色背景</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">之前的中国签证（如有）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">您上一次中国签证的复印件（如果您有）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">合法居留证明</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">您当前国家的居留许可或签证（如果在母国以外申请）</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">辅助文件</h3>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Choose <strong>一</strong> of the following:</p>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-4 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">选项A——独立旅行</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1 list-disc pl-4">
          <li>往返机票预订（可以预订——签证批准前不要买票）</li>
          <li>整个住宿期间的酒店预订</li>
          <li>显示您计划访问哪些城市的粗略行程</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">选项B——邀请函</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">中国公民或持有中国居留证的外国人的邀请函。它必须包括：</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1 list-disc pl-4">
          <li>您的个人信息（姓名、性别、出生日期、护照号码）</li>
          <li>您的旅行详细信息（到达/离开日期、您将访问的地点）</li>
          <li>邀请人信息（姓名、电话号码、地址、签名）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm text-amber-800 flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="font-bold">注：</span> The consular officer may request additional documents or an in-person interview if needed, depending on your specific situation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">照片要求</h2>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left">
          <thead class="bg-gray-50">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Specification</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Requirement</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Size</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">48毫米x33毫米</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Background</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">纯白</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Recency</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">过去6个月内拍摄</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Expression</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">中立，闭上嘴，双眼可见</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Glasses</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">不戴眼镜、太阳镜或有色镜片</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Retouching</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">没有Photoshop，没有滤镜，没有繁重的编辑</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">如果您担心自己的签证无法通过要求，许多签证中心都会提供现场拍照服务。</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">分步申请流程</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">第一步：填写COVA表格</h3>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Go to the official <a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">新冠肺炎系统（COVA.mfa.gov.cn）</a> and get the visa application form online. You need to print the form, complete it, and bring it to the visa center in person.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">在开始之前，请准备好这些：</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li>您的护照（号码、签发日期、到期日期）</li>
        <li>您的雇主或学校名称和地址</li>
        <li>您计划的出入境日期</li>
        <li>你将参观的城市的大致想法</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>重要提示：</strong> After filling out the form, download and print it. You must sign it by hand before bringing it to the visa center. Without the printed and signed form, the visa center won't accept your application.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">第二步：预约</h3>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        After submitting the COVA form, visit the <a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国签证申请服务中心网站</a> to book an appointment.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">预订期间：</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li>Select <strong>“旅游签证（L）”</strong> as the visa type</li>
        <li>选择离您最近的中心——每个中心覆盖特定地区</li>
        <li>选择一个可用的日期和时间段</li>
        <li>您将收到一封包含二维码的确认电子邮件，请保存</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <strong>找不到预约？</strong> Some centers accept walk-ins, usually early in the morning. Check your local center's policy on their website.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">第三步：访问签证中心</h3>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Bring <strong>你所有的文件</strong> to the visa center on your appointment day.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">进入后会发生什么：</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li><strong>安全检查</strong> — Your bag goes through an X-ray machine, similar to airport security</li>
        <li><strong>文件审查</strong> — A staff member checks your documents before you queue</li>
        <li><strong>Biometrics</strong> — They'll scan your fingerprints (usually both index fingers)</li>
        <li><strong>Photo</strong> — They may take a new photo on-site (so don't stress too much about your own photo)</li>
        <li><strong>Payment</strong> — Pay the visa fee (cash, card, or money order, depending on the center)</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The in-person part usually takes <strong>30-60分钟</strong> depending on the queue.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">步骤4：等待处理</h3>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li><strong>标准处理：</strong> 4-5 business days (most locations)</li>
        <li><strong>快递服务：</strong> 2-3 business days (extra fee)</li>
        <li><strong>加急服务：</strong> 1 business day (available at some locations, premium fee)</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">

      <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">第五步：领取护照</h3>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Return to the visa center with your pickup receipt.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">离开前立即检查签证：</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Is the visa type labeled <strong>L</strong>?</li>
        <li>有效期是否正确？</li>
        <li>条目数量是否正确（单个与多个）？</li>
        <li>你的名字拼写正确吗？</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If anything is wrong, tell them <strong>在你离开之前</strong>.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">官方链接</h2>

      <table class="w-full mb-8">
        <thead class="bg-gray-50">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 text-left">Resource</th>
            <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 text-left">Link</th>
            <th class="px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 text-left">Purpose</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">COVA Online Form</td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm"><a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">新冠肺炎官方网站</a></td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">在线填写签证申请表</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">领事签证指南</td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm"><a href="https://consular.mfa.gov.cn/VISA/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">consultar.mfa.gov.cn/VISA/</a></td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">中国政府的官方分步指导</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">签证中心</td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm"><a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visaforchina.cn</a></td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">查找离您最近的中心并预约</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">领事事务</td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm"><a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cs.mfa.gov.cn</a></td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700">官方要求、常见问题解答和政策更新</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">常见问题解答--L型旅游签证</h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">中国旅游签证的费用是多少？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Fees vary by nationality and number of entries. For US citizens, a single-entry L visa costs around <strong>140美元</strong>. For EU and UK citizens, expect roughly <strong>£85-£170</strong> depending on the center. Check your local visa center's fee schedule for the exact amount.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我可以申请多次入境L签证吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">是的，如果你以前有过中国签证（任何类型），你更有可能被批准多次入境。首次申请者通常会获得单次入境签证。</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我应该多早申请？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Apply <strong>1-3个月</strong> before your trip. Don'<td类='t leave it to the last minute either. The visa center website will tell you the earliest date you can submit.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我到中国后可以延长我的L签证吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">延期是可能的，但不能保证。你需要去当地公安局出入境管理办公室。在初次申请时，申请更长的期限（60或90天）更容易。</p>
        </div>

        <div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Before applying for a visa, check whether you qualify for <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-free/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">免签证入境</a> or the <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/transit-240/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">240小时交通政策</a>. If not, the L-type tourist visa is the standard route for visitors coming to China.
      </p>

      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
        *Last updated: June 2026. Always check the <a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">官方领事网站</a> for the latest requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
